1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,625
Who are you?

2
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:13,750
Weren't you just
declaring war on me?

3
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:16,375
You're… the Godfather?

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,041
Besides me, who dares
walk straight into your lair?

5
00:00:19,041 --> 00:00:20,250
How dare you!

6
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:23,000
You want a war?

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,500
I'll give you a war.

8
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:28,250
Fine. We'll see if you leave alive.

9
00:00:28,916 --> 00:00:29,791
Kill him!
